    pigeons were shaped to *"play tennis, navigate mazes, and steer model
    aircraft"*. The arena's audit trail already works this way and does not say
    so.
  - **Design:** the arena's own method is shaping — a slot is filled, then
    refined, then re-ranked, one approximation at a time. The slot records
    that the **current criterion is a parameter, not a constant**, so a future
    pass can see what standard a past result was judged against. The
    `UNSUCCESSFUL` half is the file's own verdict on the same technique applied
