  - **Backup document:** `oracle/brain/Entities/BF-Skinner.md` (ORDER 858)
    §§"Shaping", "Applied Behavior Analysis".
  - **Grade:** `LOW` on shaping as a technique; **`UNSUCCESSFUL`** on shaping as
