is 0", and `citation_remediation.py` reported **0 PROVEN, 39 MUST RE-READ → 0
MUST RE-READ, 6 AMBIGUOUS twin**, so the block was cleared and a normal tranche
opened. The walk cleared the tail of `Prospective-Memory/`, entered
