*Tranche 66 (ORDER 1581–1600 = **20 files**, ceiling respected exactly: 20 was
reached at ORDER 1600 and ORDER 1601 is next in order and was **left unread**
rather than jumped). Remediation was **discharged on arrival** — the standing
priority from four prior passes was "no new tranche until MUST RE-READ is 0", and
